1:["$","main",null,{"className":"reading-page post-reading-page","children":["$","article",null,{"className":"post-article h-entry","children":[["$","$L7",null,{"className":"u-url sr-only","href":"/blog/record-of-abnormal-investigation-of-public-network-traffic","children":["一次由公网流出带宽飙升引发的服务器性能排查实录"," 永久链接"]}],["$","a",null,{"className":"p-author h-card sr-only","href":"https://github.com/hedon954","rel":"author","children":"Hedon"}],["$","figure",null,{"className":"article-hero article-cover","children":["$","img",null,{"className":"u-photo","src":"https://hedon.top/hedonspace/banner/record-of-abnormal-investigation-of-public-network-traffic.jpg","alt":"一次由公网流出带宽飙升引发的服务器性能排查实录 的文章封面"}]}],["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header article-summary-row","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"故障排查"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"p-name","children":"一次由公网流出带宽飙升引发的服务器性能排查实录"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"article-deck p-summary","children":"本文详细记录了一次由公网流出带宽飙升引发的服务器性能故障排查。我们从监控图表入手，利用 iftop 实时追踪流量去向，并最终通过 nethogs 锁定应用。该案例揭示了新功能配置对网络资源的巨大影响，为解决类似问题提供了宝贵经验。"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-meta","children":[["$","time",null,{"className":"dt-published","dateTime":"2025-08-15T15:30:20.000Z","children":["发布于 ","2025/08/15"]}],"$undefined",["$","span",null,{"children":"$undefined"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["约 ","1,542"," 字"]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-layout","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-column","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"e-content","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"markdown-body","children":[["$","p","p-0",{"children":["最近，我们的服务器监控系统发出了紧急警报：服务器的各项关键性能指标在 ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"2025 年 8 月 15 日 11:30 左右"}],"出现了同步飙升。面对这一异常，我们并没有急于猜测，而是通过一个核心线索——公网流出流量，一步步揭开了问题的真相。本文将详细记录我们的排查过程，并深入解析每一步的工具应用与背后原理。"]}],"\n",["$","h4","h4-0",{"id":"第一步从宏观监控入手锁定异常的核心","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#第一步从宏观监控入手锁定异常的核心","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#第一步从宏观监控入手锁定异常的核心"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"第一步：从宏观监控入手，锁定异常的核心","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":6,"offset":160},"end":{"line":3,"column":25,"offset":179}}}]},"children":"第一步：从宏观监控入手，锁定异常的核心"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"故障排查的第一步，是细致分析监控图表，从中提取关键信息，从而圈定问题发生的精确时间。"}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":["$","$L8","img-0",{"src":"https://hedonspace.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/img/image-20250815152916476.png","alt":"异常现象","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"img","properties":{"src":"https://hedonspace.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/img/image-20250815152916476.png","alt":"异常现象"},"children":[],"position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1,"offset":225},"end":{"line":7,"column":88,"offset":312}}}}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-3",{"children":["如上图所示，我们发现，在 ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"2025 年 8 月 15 日 11:30 左右"}],"，服务器的各项指标出现了显著异常："]}],"\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"公网流出带宽"}],"：在 11:37:00 这个时间点，公网流出带宽达到了惊人的",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"110.899 M bit/s"}]," 的峰值，远超正常水平。与此同时，公网流入带宽也有轻微增加，但量级远小于流出带宽。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"CPU 使用率"}],"：在带宽飙升的同时，CPU 使用率也从 25% 左右的正常水平，迅速升高到接近",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"100%"}]," 的峰值。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"磁盘 I/O"}],"：磁盘的读操作吞吐量和次数也出现了同步的峰值。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-4",{"children":"此外，网络连接数的监控图也揭示了重要线索："}],"\n",["$","ul","ul-1",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":["在 11:30 左右，服务器的网络连接总数从约 2.5K 激增至 ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"5.5K 左右"}],"。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["其中，",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"NON_ESTABLISHED"}],"（非活跃）连接数急剧增加，最高达到了约 ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"2.475K"}],"，与 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"ESTABLISHED"}],"（已建立）连接数几乎持平。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-5",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"排查原理"}],"：多项关键指标在同一时间点同步异常，这强烈暗示着某个进程或任务正在大量消耗系统资源。公网带宽的异常是本次故障的核心线索，它将我们的排查方向聚焦于网络流量。同时，网络连接数中非活跃连接的激增，表明问题可能与高频率的连接建立与关闭有关，而非简单的持续高流量。这些宏观的监控数据，为我们后续深入排查提供了明确的起点和方向。"]}],"\n",["$","h4","h4-1",{"id":"第二步iftop-定位流量去向一剑封喉","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#第二步iftop-定位流量去向一剑封喉","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#第二步iftop-定位流量去向一剑封喉"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"第二步：","position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":6,"offset":907},"end":{"line":22,"column":10,"offset":911}}},{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"iftop","position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":10,"offset":911},"end":{"line":22,"column":17,"offset":918}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":10,"offset":911},"end":{"line":22,"column":17,"offset":918}}},{"type":"text","value":" 定位流量去向，一剑封喉","position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":17,"offset":918},"end":{"line":22,"column":29,"offset":930}}}]},"children":["第二步：","$L9"," 定位流量去向，一剑封喉"]}]}],"\n","$La","\n","$Lb","\n","$Lc","\n","$Ld","\n","$Le","\n","$Lf","\n","$L10","\n","$L11","\n","$L12","\n","$L13","\n","$L14","\n","$L15","\n","$L16","\n","$L17","\n","$L18","\n","$L19"]}]}],"$L1a","$L1b","$L1c"]}],"$L1d"]}]]}]}]
