9:["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"iftop"}]
a:["$","p","p-6",{"children":["既然问题是公网流出流量异常，那么这些流量究竟流向哪里？这是我们排查的下一个关键问题。我们运行了 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"iftop"}]," 工具，它能够实时监控网络流量的流向，结果令人震惊："]}]
b:["$","p","p-7",{"children":["$","$L8","img-0",{"src":"https://hedonspace.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/img/image-20250815153946932.png","alt":"iftop 命令显示结果","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"img","properties":{"src":"https://hedonspace.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/img/image-20250815153946932.png","alt":"iftop 命令显示结果"},"children":[],"position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":1,"offset":1015},"end":{"line":26,"column":96,"offset":1110}}}}]}]
c:["$","ul","ul-2",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"iftop"}]," 实时监控显示，服务器的公网流出流量（",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"=>"}],"）绝大部分都流向了 IP 地址 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"xxx"}],"。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["流出速率高达每秒 ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"165M bits/s"}],"，与监控图上的带宽峰值完全吻合。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"iftop"}]," 底部的 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"TX"}],"（发送）流量峰值达到了 ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"181M bits"}],"，进一步证实了带宽飙升的根源。"]}],"\n"]}]
d:["$","p","p-8",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"排查原理"}],"：",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"iftop"}]," 的强大之处在于它的",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"实时性和直观性"}],"。它将服务器抽象的带宽数据，具象化为\"本地 IP A 到远端 IP B 的流量\"。通过观察 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"iftop"}]," 的输出，我们立刻将目光从\"哪台服务器出了问题\"转移到\"这台服务器在向哪里发送数据\"\"，从而大大缩短了排查路径。"]}]
e:["$","h4","h4-2",{"id":"第三步nethogs-锁定应用进程确认元凶","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#第三步nethogs-锁定应用进程确认元凶","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#第三步nethogs-锁定应用进程确认元凶"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"第三步：","position":{"start":{"line":34,"column":6,"offset":1423},"end":{"line":34,"column":10,"offset":1427}}},{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"nethogs","position":{"start":{"line":34,"column":10,"offset":1427},"end":{"line":34,"column":19,"offset":1436}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":34,"column":10,"offset":1427},"end":{"line":34,"column":19,"offset":1436}}},{"type":"text","value":" 锁定应用进程，确认元凶","position":{"start":{"line":34,"column":19,"offset":1436},"end":{"line":34,"column":31,"offset":1448}}}]},"children":["第三步：",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"nethogs"}]," 锁定应用进程，确认元凶"]}]}]
f:["$","p","p-9",{"children":["我们已经知道是服务器在向 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"xxx"}]," 发送大量数据，但具体是哪个应用在做这件事？我们使用 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"nethogs"}],"工具，它能够按进程实时监控流量，最终锁定了“元凶”："]}]
10:["$","ul","ul-3",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"nethogs"}]," 的输出明确显示，",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"snakeweb_"}]," 应用"]}],"是产生这些高流量的进程。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["其发送（",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"SENT"}],"）和接收（",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"RECEIVED"}],"）流量都远超其他进程，证实了它是本次故障的直接“元凶”。"]}],"\n"]}]
11:["$","p","p-10",{"children":["$","$L8","img-0",{"src":"https://hedonspace.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/img/image-20250815154151114.png","alt":"nethogs","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"img","properties":{"src":"https://hedonspace.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/img/image-20250815154151114.png","alt":"nethogs"},"children":[],"position":{"start":{"line":41,"column":1,"offset":1640},"end":{"line":41,"column":91,"offset":1730}}}}]}]
12:["$","p","p-11",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"排查原理"}],"：",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"nethogs"}]," 将流量与具体的进程 ID（PID）和程序路径关联起来，为我们提供了最终的、无可辩驳的证据。至此，我们已经完整地锁定了问题：",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"snakeweb_"}]," 应用向 IP ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"xxx"}]," 发送大量数据。"]}]
13:["$","h4","h4-3",{"id":"第四步发现-time_wait-堆积理解行为模式","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#第四步发现-time_wait-堆积理解行为模式","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#第四步发现-time_wait-堆积理解行为模式"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"第四步：发现 ","position":{"start":{"line":45,"column":8,"offset":1853},"end":{"line":45,"column":15,"offset":1860}}},{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"TIME_WAIT","position":{"start":{"line":45,"column":15,"offset":1860},"end":{"line":45,"column":26,"offset":1871}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":45,"column":15,"offset":1860},"end":{"line":45,"column":26,"offset":1871}}},{"type":"text","value":" 堆积，理解行为模式","position":{"start":{"line":45,"column":26,"offset":1871},"end":{"line":45,"column":36,"offset":1881}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":45,"column":6,"offset":1851},"end":{"line":45,"column":38,"offset":1883}}}]},"children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":["第四步：发现 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"TIME_WAIT"}]," 堆积，理解行为模式"]}]}]}]
14:["$","p","p-12",{"children":["在确认了应用和流量去向后，我们回过头来审视最初的一些异常现象。网络连接数的监控图显示，",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"NON_ESTABLISHED"}],"（非活跃）连接数在 11:30 左右急剧增加，最高达到了约 ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"2.475K"}],"，与 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"ESTABLISHED"}],"（已建立）连接数几乎持平。"]}]
15:["$","p","p-13",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"排查原理"}],"：大量的 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"TIME_WAIT"}]," 连接是 TCP 连接在",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"主动关闭后"}],"保持的一段等待时间。这一现象揭示了问题的另一面：",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"snakeweb_"}]," 应用在发送数据时，采用了",["$","strong","strong-2",{"children":"高频率的短连接方式"}],"。每一次连接的建立和关闭，都在系统中留下了大量的 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"TIME_WAIT"}]," 状态连接，虽然不直接消耗带宽，但却占用了文件描述符等系统资源，成为了一个需要优化的次要问题。"]}]
